<div class="card">
  <h1 class="site-home-h2" style="font-size:2rem">Companies we admire.</h1>
  <p class="site-words">We model this website, our videos and the way we work on a few companies that do it well. Here they are, with one honest line each on why.</p>
  <style>.ad-q{padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line,#e5e5e5)}.ad-q h2{font-size:1.05rem;margin:0 0 4px}</style>
  <div class="ad-q"><h2><a href="https://37signals.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">37signals</a></h2><p class="site-words">They show that a small company can build calm, useful software, say plainly how it works and still make a living. Their book Getting Real shapes how we decide what to build and what to leave out.</p></div>
  <div class="ad-q"><h2><a href="https://basecamp.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Basecamp</a></h2><p class="site-words">One page for each thing it does, written in plain words with real screens. That is the pattern we follow for our own feature pages.</p></div>
  <div class="ad-q"><h2><a href="https://hey.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">HEY</a></h2><p class="site-words">A product with an opinion, explained in a few short, confident sentences. Much of how this site is laid out, and how we film our videos, comes from looking at theirs.</p></div>
  <p class="site-words">More will be added.</p>
</div>
